{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：07:46 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"消防到場灌救。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/8f3bc8f64346857205de3345da283d63/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-10_at_23_26_28.jpeg\"/>\n<p>旺角發生火警。今日（11日）早上7時10分，新填地街316至320號永福大樓一住宅單位，據報有充電器起火冒煙。消防接報到場，動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，至早上7時39分將火救熄。消息稱，初步最少3人不適，包括2名男子和1名男嬰；14男11女疏散。</p>\n<img alt=\"一名男子被送上救護車接受治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/07180d0442258036324558bf197fb7e1/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-10_at_23_32_56.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男嬰在救護車上接受治理。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/947a953f4ff3725ccfa74047d57e90f3/2026-11/2_9.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有居民帶同寵物逃生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ca1a3a92f8ef0d1d6577f2f267b74b60/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_51_56_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防到場灌救。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0033696b46feab546bf493aa049ad91a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_48_39_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"居民疏散。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/1daf92b4ee26d9ebbedcc5af8e202fe2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_48_39.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/467645d9a1a9386bc6501b2ede68d4c7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_48_38_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e7c9edf523f8338767f15e4015c9118f/2026-11/1_1_16.jpeg\"/>\n<p>居於大廈3樓的姓夏小學四年級女生，事後猶有餘悸講述走火警經過。她哭訴火警發生時她「好驚」，有人拍門並突然有消防員「衝咗入嚟」，她於是告知姐姐，「姐姐即刻叫我走，之後叫埋哥哥走」。她逃生後警員怕她着涼，亦借出風褸給她穿上。</p>\n<p>現場所見，大廈搭有棚架及圍網，有居民帶同寵物逃生。火警期間，新填地街與登打士街暫時封閉。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c585c9302a745eefa61ee766af16ebfb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_48_38.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大廈搭有棚架及圍網。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/7218a4fbcdc5345d75094c0febda95a2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_48_37.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"居民走火警逃生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/27371ab5d22eee98006e2cb39d8b9e04/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_08_02_13.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/70044c1a79b87ca3f3887491c50d298a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_08_02_12_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/286e4c192d0f8303b4446405abdea7e3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_08_02_12_1_.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T00:49:34.223975+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":13,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T00:26:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T00:43:10.760807+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T00:43:10.760807+00:00","content_hash":"597f436496eeaa662efa7c68199896b06cbe1a4d65acdfa72cbedf85cb4dadc2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}